[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21782.67, "timestamp": "06:03:02", "text": "艾普丽尔一直问她丈夫的情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21785.31, "timestamp": "06:03:05", "text": "然后发生了什么事？狼做了什么？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21786.485, "timestamp": "06:03:06", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"matilda, where is my child! bring him this instant!!\"\" to which matilda replied"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21787.468, "timestamp": "06:03:07", "text": "杀死孩子或带走孩子是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21791.35, "timestamp": "06:03:11", "text": "这是什么？嗯……那个红色的字是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21794.43, "timestamp": "06:03:14", "text": "故事又红了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21797.11, "timestamp": "06:03:17", "text": "呃，红色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21799.868, "timestamp": "06:03:19", "text": "浅红色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21805.27, "timestamp": "06:03:25", "text": "小女孩的故事 W 的故事 小红帽"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21806.628, "timestamp": "06:03:26", "text": "小红帽：谢谢，谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21808.23, "timestamp": "06:03:28", "text": "谢谢你，这就是小红帽的故事吗？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21811.391, "timestamp": "06:03:31", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "red riding hood"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21812.03, "timestamp": "06:03:32", "text": "小红帽来到了玛蒂尔达的住处"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21815.03, "timestamp": "06:03:35", "text": "我的孩子在哪里？立刻把他带过来！"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21815.797, "timestamp": "06:03:35", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"i-i dont know, he should've been here, i personally took care of that\""}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21817.03, "timestamp": "06:03:37", "text": "玛蒂尔达"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21818.59, "timestamp": "06:03:38", "text": "回复"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21822.59, "timestamp": "06:03:42", "text": "好吧，玛蒂尔达怎么回答的？我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21824.35, "timestamp": "06:03:44", "text": "他本该在这里，我亲自照顾过他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21827.39, "timestamp": "06:03:47", "text": "那你个人说的“个人”是什么意思呢？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21831.586, "timestamp": "06:03:51", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "then, arpil found something"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21832.273, "timestamp": "06:03:52", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "......"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21833.11, "timestamp": "06:03:53", "text": "搞定了，哦不，玛蒂尔达，你！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21835.83, "timestamp": "06:03:55", "text": "巴卡等"}]